OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 10 APR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GMark Forrest introduces specially
OL,6,     Grecorded performances from Perth
OL,7,     Gof chamber music evoking the
OL,8,     Gnight and concludes his plainsong-
OL,9,     Ginspired theme with a symphony by
OL,10,     GRachmaninov.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod explores the
OL,13,     Gorigins and evolution of George
OL,14,     GGershwin's opera Porgy and Bess.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GPetroc introduces live music from
OL,17,     Gthe Urban Folk Quartet and
OL,18,     Gpianist Hanni Liang.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,22,     Gfavourites.
