OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 10 APR
OL,4,G2200FLate Junction
OL,5,     GJoin Verity Sharp as she takes a
OL,6,     Gspin around the world of
OL,7,     Gexperimental listening, from the
OL,8,     Gbellows of church organs to the
OL,9,     Gexistential questioning of a
OL,10,     Gvirtual assistant.
OL,11,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,12,     GTonight, Soweto is joined by
OL,13,     Gleading British jazz saxophonist,
OL,14,     Gmulti-instrumentalist and
OL,15,     Gcomposer Courtney Pine, as his
OL,16,     GFriday night guest.
OL,17,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,18,     GThe Minetti Quartet and pianist
OL,19,     GKit Armstrong perform music by
OL,20,     GSchubert, Schumann and Mozart.
OL,21,     GJohn Shea presents.
